%% NEXUS anomaly → discovery control loop
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Observation
    Observation --> AnomalyCheck: prediction mismatch
    AnomalyCheck --> NormalFlow: below threshold
    AnomalyCheck --> BroadcastAnomaly: score ≥ threshold

    NormalFlow --> Observation: continue monitoring

    state BroadcastAnomaly {
        [*] --> FanOut
        FanOut --> QuestionState
        FanOut --> PatternState
        FanOut --> MemoryRecall
        FanOut --> CuriosityBoost
    }

    QuestionState --> Reframe: question about the question
    Reframe --> HypothesisSpace

    PatternState --> StructureFound: recurring motif
    MemoryRecall --> SimilarPastCases: retrieval
    CuriosityBoost --> SearchExpansion: exploration pressure

    StructureFound --> HypothesisSpace
    SimilarPastCases --> HypothesisSpace
    SearchExpansion --> HypothesisSpace

    HypothesisSpace --> TheoryCompetition: ≥2 candidates
    TheoryCompetition --> Prediction
    Prediction --> Simulation: mental rollout
    Simulation --> Experiment: discriminating test

    Experiment --> Evidence: CCOS world + oracle
    Evidence --> EvidenceGate

    EvidenceGate --> Support: confirms
    EvidenceGate --> Falsify: contradicts
    EvidenceGate --> Inconclusive: unclear

    Falsify --> HypothesisEvolution
    HypothesisEvolution --> HypothesisSpace

    Support --> Abstraction
    Abstraction --> Transfer
    Transfer --> MemoryUpdate
    MemoryUpdate --> MetaCognition
    MetaCognition --> Observation

    Inconclusive --> QuestionState
